Comprehensive multi-area refactoring based on 2026-08-25 optimization.

## Test & Quality Improvements
- Python tests: 46→67 passing, 2→0 failures (scripts/ + demo/tests)
- Rust tests: 99→126 passing (+27 new unit tests)
- Cargo clippy warnings: 60→0 (all eliminated)
- CI scripts: All 11 scripts now validate locally with correct references
- Smoke tests: Full end-to-end demo validated (Desktop to startup)

## Core Bug Fixes (packing_assistant)
1. CoG mixed-mass bug: Fixed volume/mass unit confusion for missing-weight boxes
2. CoG repair pipeline: Added "wall-attached + span≥80%" guard for mid50 metrics
3. O(n²) hot paths: Converted to hash-based lookups
4. WS hub event buffering: Added limits to prevent memory leaks
5. Unknown container types: Explicit fallback annotation instead of silent errors
6. Missing/invalid box dimensions: No longer silently treating as 1mm³

## Gateway & API Fixes (gateway/app.py)
1. Fixed 8 endpoints calling undefined _load_session (whatif, table parsing, export, checks)
2. Fixed /api/runs/compare routing order being overridden by /api/runs/{run_id}
3. Added global exception handler with Chinese JSON error messages
4. Added path traversal protection for table parsing and run-pdf exports
5. Implemented 20MB upload size limit and async/blocking call separation
6. Graceful degradation for missing API Key configuration

## Workbench (Rust: 60→0 clippy warnings)
1. Fixed character-boundary chunking for Chinese multi-byte characters (agent.rs)
2. Fixed SSE parser losing lines across network packet boundaries (llm.rs)
3. Fixed URL decoding panic on multi-byte characters following % (websearch.rs)
4. Fixed catalog mutex poisoning causing silent lock loss and write races (store.rs)
5. Fixed WebSocket session recovery and HITL new session handling (api.rs)
6. Improved MCP Content-Length limit (16MB) and zip/zlib explosion limits (mcp.rs)
7. Added 27 new unit tests for edge cases

## Frontend & Demo
1. Bundled Vue 2.7.16 locally (frontend/vendor/vue.min.js) as CDN fallback
2. Fixed WebSocket binding to initial session instead of current session
3. Added graceful degradation for missing /api/config and /api/threads endpoints
4. Chinese error messages throughout user-facing text
5. Removed all fetch calls without try/catch; added button debouncing
6. Demo API config validation: now validates before writing environment
7. LLM timeouts: explicit timeout handling with graceful fallback
8. Corrupt user_catalog.json: recovery instead of crash
9. Delete endpoint: .md/.txt whitelist to prevent unintended file removal

## Documentation & Standards
- Fixed 7 broken relative links across 196 markdown files
- Normalized all 66 SKILL.md files to uniform structure (4 files corrected)
- Corrected references to non-existent CLI command 'civil'
- Fixed 3 malformed table structures
- Updated AGENTS.md and README.md with current capabilities
- Added comprehensive _changes/ documentation for each area

## New & Updated
- _changes/: Detailed per-area changelog (packing_assistant.md, workbench.md,
  gateway_scripts.md, frontend.md, demo.md, docs.md)
- frontend/vendor/vue.min.js: Bundled locally for offline/unreliable CDN scenarios

## Backwards Compatibility
All external APIs preserved:
- HTTP routes and request/response structures unchanged
- MCP protocol surface unchanged
- CLI entry points unchanged
- Knowledge base content (346 files) verified for encoding
- All tests pass with existing data
